      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Prefetching strategy that prefetches the siblings of the requested node.</para>
          <para>To avoid disconnected trees, this flag will also prefetch the parent. Siblings will be prefetched before descendants.</para>
          <para>See FLAG_PREFETCH_ANCESTORS for information on where these flags can be used.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/accessibility/AccessibilityNodeInfo#FLAG_PREFETCH_SIBLINGS" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.view.accessibility.AccessibilityNodeInfo.FLAG_PREFETCH_SIBLINGS</code>.</a></format></para>
